-- statement:
--   A definitions bundle of the split of OpenAI's proof of `OAI.EilenbergGanea.source_main`, carved from OpenAI's openai/math development (OpenAI, *A finitely generated counterexample to the Eilenberg–Ganea conjecture*, OpenAI Math Release, September 23, 2026, result family 249, [github.com/openai/math](https://github.com/openai/math) at commit adc7f12, Apache License 2.0) and ported to Lean 4.33.1 and Mathlib 0df444a. The declarations and their proofs are OpenAI's.
--
--   **Contents.** It holds 11 declarations of OpenAI's Lean: 10 definitions and 1 instance. The definitions and types are `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.edgeLookupCodes_0`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.h1CodeData_11`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.h1CodeData_12`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.h1CodeData_13`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.h1CodeData_23`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_1`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_14`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedEncoding.adjCodes`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedEncoding.indexedAdj`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedSU2`.
--
--   **Sources.** They come from these modules of lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea, lean/OAI/AlgebraicTopology, lean/OAI/GroupTheory, in whole or in part: [`SeedChains`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/SeedChains.lean), [`SeedContraction`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/SeedContraction.lean), [`SeedHolonomy`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/SeedHolonomy.lean).
--
--   **Imports.** It imports no bundle or statement, only Mathlib.
--
--   **Imported by** (directly, in this split): the bundles `OAIEG018`, `OAIEG030`, `OAIEG032`, `OAIEG033` and `OAIEG035`.
